{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"559","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Equivalent Strings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Today on a lecture about strings Gerald learned a new definition of string equivalency. Two strings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" of equal length are called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"equivalent"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in one of the two cases: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" They are equal. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If we split string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" into two halves of the same size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2"},{"kind":"text","text":", and string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" into two halves of the same size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b2"},{"kind":"text","text":", then one of the following is correct: "},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"kind":"list"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is equivalent to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2"},{"kind":"text","text":" is equivalent to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b2"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is equivalent to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b2"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2"},{"kind":"text","text":" is equivalent to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As a home task, the teacher gave two strings to his students and asked to determine if they are equivalent."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Gerald has already completed this home task. Now it's your turn!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first two lines of the input contain two strings given by the teacher. Each of them has the length from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"200 000"},{"kind":"text","text":" and consists of lowercase English letters. The strings have the same length."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes), if these two strings are equivalent, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes) otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"